    },
    {
      "text": "Combine ketchup, brown sugar, bacon bits, pineapple, and 1 dash Worcestershire sauce in a small bowl; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine ground beef, bread crumbs, saltines, onion, egg, salt, garlic, black pepper, and remaining 2 dashes Worcestershire sauce in a large bowl; mix well. Pat into a 9x5-inch loaf pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
